 * @file http3_qpack
 * @brief Bounded zero-dynamic-table QPACK decoder for HTTP/3.
 *
 * This decoder is an interoperable RFC 9204 profile for endpoints that
 * advertise SETTINGS_QPACK_MAX_TABLE_CAPACITY=0 and
 * SETTINGS_QPACK_BLOCKED_STREAMS=0. Applications that negotiate dynamic
 * QPACK adapt a stateful external decoder through ntl/net/http3/framing.
